# GitHub's Windows runners set core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites LF to CRLF on
# checkout. That breaks two gates for reasons that have nothing to do with the
# change under test: `cargo fmt --check` sees every line as modified, and the
# `generated` gate compares artifacts byte-for-byte, which CRLF defeats.
#
# Every tracked text file in this repo is already LF, so this normalizes nothing
# today — it stops the three-OS gate matrix from failing spuriously on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
